  header: "Mirror Fragment 3 of 3  \xB7  Making peace with oneself"
  note: 'The tired me and the hopeful me were never two different people.

    I
    don''t have to leave one behind to become the other.

    I can hold both, and
    still be whole.'
  closing: 'Loving yourself is a journey.

    You don''t have to become someone
    else to deserve it.'
